  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/F88942">Remark <span data-tag="F88942">2.2.5.3</span>.</a> The Joyal model structure is <em>not</em> right proper. To see this, we note that the inclusion $\Lambda ^2_1 \subseteq \Delta ^2$ is a categorical equivalence, but it does not remain so after pulling back via the fibration $\Delta ^{ \{ 0,2\}  } \subseteq \Delta ^2$. </p>
